window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Staplers aren't the only things getting jammed.<br> <br> In this scorchingly addictive collection of ten high-heat office erotica stories, enemies become lovers, coworkers become liabilities, and every locked door becomes an invitation.<br> <br> Expect stolen glances across cubicles, whispered threats in meeting rooms, and copy room hookups hot enough to melt toner. These aren’t soft romances—they’re raw, ruthless, and dripping with tension. Think desks used for anything but spreadsheets, HR policies broken by the second paragraph, and rivalries that end in breathless, sweat-slicked surrender.<br> <br> Some of them swore they’d never cross the line. Others sprinted toward it. But all of them are about to find out what happens when professionalism meets obsession… and no one can keep their hands to themselves.<br> <b><br> Zero rules. No regrets. Just pure, unapologetic workplace chaos.</b><br> <br> Listen to it in private. Or don’t. Just don’t say we didn’t warn you.</p>"; 
